  abilityId: 1840278
  abilityName: Flashfire Shockwave
  abilityDesc: 26 combo powerful Thunder attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining
    HP), 3 combo powerful Thunder attack on single foe, considerably boosts Atk,
    Def, Rec and enormously boosts critical hit rate of Thunder types for 3 turns,
    hugely boosts Thunder elemental damage for 3 turns, damage taken hugely boosts
    BB gauge for 3 turns & considerably boosts critical damage for 3 turns
